and cur_vec.sum() < 0.01:\n            update_type = 'exponential'\n            \n        if update_type == 'direct':\n            # Do linear update\n            pass\n            \n        # \n        updated_cand = best_cand\n        \n        # Breakout condition when score is too small\n        if best_scr < 1.5:\n            print(\"Target score achieved early, terminating early.\")\n            break\n            \n    return best_cand.tolist(), best_scr\n```...\n\n```python\ndef fast_convolve(a):\n    \"\"\"Linear auto-convolution via FFT\"\"\"\n    # (Implementation details go here)\n\ndef fast_compute_grad(a):\n    \"\"\"Computes an analytical or numerical gradient approximation\"\"\"\n    # (Implementation details go here)\n\ndef adjust_factor(a, factor, metrics):\n    \"\"\"Applies dimension-dependent adjustments to the vector\"\"\"\n    # (Implementation details go here)\n    \ndef local_optimization(a, time_limit, **kwargs):\n    \"\"\"Performs a coordinated descent to polish the last candidate\"\"\"\n    # (Implementation details go here)\n```...",
